    // Note: telo with no args reads stdin? Earlier telo with no args and empty stdin gave 0 0 to stderr (total 0). Good - fn NULL => stdin.
    // With file, total is sum of lengths? For 14 total, gave 0 14. Good.
    while(rd.next(r)){
